  "details": "This is related to the new performance ranking system. \n\nYou must fully download and load an avatar before it becomes blocked by the system, if you've set it up to block any avatars at all.\n\nThis slows down the downloading and loading of other avatars. \n\nIt should be trivial to save the information server-side on avatar upload and use that instead of relying on the client to check if the avatar should be hidden after it loads.",
